    <h1 class="article-title">What Happens to PDF Metadata When You Use ChatGPT, Gemini, or Claude to Write a Document</h1>
    <p class="article-subtitle">We actually tested it: pasted AI-drafted text into a document, exported it to PDF, and inspected the raw metadata. Here's exactly what survives.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span>📅 October 2026</span>
      <span>⏱ 15 min read</span>
      <span>✍️ FileIntel</span>
    </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual" id="hero-visual">
      <div class="hero-visual-inner" id="hero-visual-inner">
        <img src="/images/pdf-metadata-mismatch.jpg" alt="PDF document with visible content compared with hidden metadata fields" width="720" height="576" loading="eager" class="hero-img" id="hero-img" />
